  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIIS udredningsarbejde om udviklingsfinansiering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This study has the objective of analysing and documenting experiences and trends within financing for development, which is an instrument used more and more often these past years. The study will analyse the progress within different types of instruments for development financing. Furthermore, there will be a particular focus on the progress of OECD/DAC-reporting of ODA and the possibilities of co-financing ODA with new types of financing.</narrative>
  </description>
